			],
			"Message": "style(Docs): Normalize HTML whitespace in FilesystemFootprint and README\n\nReplace HTML-encoded non-breaking spaces (`&#x2001;`) with regular spaces in table-header separator cells across all FilesystemFootprint documentation subpages (Cleanup, Encapsulation, EnvironmentVariables, PerElement, PlatformPaths, UserDotfile).\n\nIn README.md, add the missing Land emoji to the main header, and normalize separator formatting in the element grid — replace `&#x2001;+&#x2001;` with ` + ` in all element link labels (Common, Echo, Vine, Mountain, Rest, Output, Cocoon, Wind, Worker, Sky, Mist, Maintain, Grove, Editor). Also fix the Funding section to use a regular space instead of `&#x2001;`.\n\nNo behavioral changes — purely whitespace and entity normalization across documentation files.",
			"SHA": "4c62dc9f15b754a8ea19b6e9a1d40759fb6ee861"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-07-07T20:11:53Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				157,
				27
			],
			"Message": "Refactor documentation to replace non-breaking spaces with HTML entities for consistency and improved rendering across various platforms. Updated multiple markdown files including UserDotfile.md, InterComponentProtocol.md, Polyfills.md, README.md, and Workflow documentation to enhance readability and maintainability.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "fdf5d27e3b97c8527b0fb5183c6bc457d84d50ae"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-07-05T16:10:20Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				157,
				4
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Add Git hooks for automatic submodule updates and restore .npmrc\n\nIntroduce `post-checkout` and `post-merge` Git hooks that automatically run `git submodule update --init --remote --recursive --merge` after every checkout or merge, ensuring that vendored submodules (Dependency, Element, Documentation/Rust) always track their remote branch tip without manual intervention.\n\nRestore the `.npmrc` file from the `.npmrc.bak` backup with updated normalization: add `node-options` (lowercase variant) alongside `node_options`, add the `registry` key, and reorder entries alphabetically. The previous deletion of `.npmrc` caused the configuration to fall back to `.npmrc.bak`; this rename-and-edit brings `.npmrc` back with the correct content.",
			"SHA": "4d0eb9ec6071a80fab92e43f232e703ba2477d88"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T23:30:39Z",
			"File": [
				"⡿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				27
			],
			"Message": "style(Land): Normalize shell indentation and redirect spacing\n\nReindent all Maintain/ shell scripts to use two-level case statement indentation (case body indented once, statement body indented twice) for consistency with POSIX shell best practices. Normalize redirect spacing from `>/dev/null 2>&1` to `> /dev/null 2>&1` and stderr redirects from `2>/dev/null` to `2> /dev/null` across scripts and scripts in Maintain/Debug/, Maintain/Release/, Maintain/Repository/, Maintain/Script/, Maintain/Test/, Maintain/Transfer/, Maintain/Integration/, and Maintain/List/.\n\nAlso update Format.sh to align pipe placement (backslash-continued pipes at end of line, not start of next) and fix the `&&` / `||` placement in SignBundle.sh for consistent shell pipeline formatting.\n\nNo behavioral changes — purely formatting normalization applied by shfmt and manual review.",
			"SHA": "1ad6c2c131667ee7a0df3aa0c2b5f3cbcb6c50d0"
		}
	],
